    "line": 1.4900000095367432,
    "spacing": -0.78,
    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "The drone has a 1.40 m wingspan and can carry a 12 kg payload. Designed as a first responder in alpine terrain, it takes off and lands vertically using tilting rotors. It has a 1080p digital camera, a thermal camera and 10× optical zoom with a 30 km range. It was tested using a three-billion-cell CFD simulation on AMD MI300X GPU servers.",
        "color": {
          "r": 0.5397010445594788,
          "g": 0.5397010445594788,
          "b": 0.5397010445594788
        },
