          "b": 0.8961463570594788
        },
        "underline": true,
        "link": null
      },
      {
        "text": " and a desktop version for macOS, Windows and Linux. Its modern interface offers deep text editing, watermarking, text insertion, signing, password protection, redaction, translation, conversion and more. You can get it from the website or the public GitHub repository ",
