    "spacing": -0.78,
    "segments": [
      {
        "text": "This 2.5 m experimental UAV has a working prototype undergoing testing. Three motors produce 21 kg of thrust, and its tilting mechanism enables vertical take-off and landing. It has completed a short flight, but the battery system is being redesigned before further testing. It uses a custom 350 Wh lithium-ion battery pack and weighs 7.5 kg in its current unfinished configuration.",
